"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"forgotten"},{"surface":"கானவன்","parts":[{"text":"கான்","lemma":"கான்","gloss":"forest"},{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"he/man"}],"gloss":"forest-man/hunter"},{"surface":"ஞாங்கர்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாங்கர்","lemma":"ஞாங்கர்","gloss":"nearby/place"}],"gloss":"nearby"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடியுடை","parts":[{"text":"கடி","lemma":"கடி","gloss":"protection/guard"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"guarded"},{"surface":"மரந்தொறும்","parts":[{"text":"மரம்","lemma":"மரம்","gloss":"tree"},{"text":"தொறும்","lemma":"தொறும்","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"on every tree"},{"surface":"படுவலை","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"catching/falling"},{"text":"வலை","lemma":"வலை","gloss":"net"}],"gloss":"catching-net"},{"surface":"மாட்டும்","parts":[{"text":"மாட்டு","lemma":"மாட்டு","gloss":"fasten/hook"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual/future suffix"}],"gloss":"fastens"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குன்ற","parts":[{"text":"குன்று","lemma":"குன்று","gloss":"hill"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"genitive/adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"of the hill"},{"surface":"நாட","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land/country"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"vocative suffix"}],"gloss":"O lord of the land!"},{"surface":"தகுமோ","parts":[{"text":"தகு","lemma":"தகு","gloss":"be fit"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual suffix"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"is it fit?"},{"surface":"பைஞ்சுனை","parts":[{"text":"பைஞ்சுனை","lemma":"பைஞ்சுனை","gloss":"fresh mountain pool"}],"gloss":"fresh mountain pool","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குவளை","parts":[{"text":"குவளை","lemma":"குவளை","gloss":"water lily"}],"gloss":"water lily"},{"surface":"தண்தழை","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"தழை","lemma":"தழை","gloss":"foliage/leaf-garment"}],"gloss":"cool leaf-garment"},{"surface":"இவள்","parts":[{"text":"இவள்","lemma":"இவள்","gloss":"she/this woman"}],"gloss":"she"},{"surface":"ஈண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஈண்டு","lemma":"ஈண்டு","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"வருந்த","parts":[{"text":"வருந்து","lemma":"வருந்து","gloss":"suffer"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to suffer"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நயந்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"நய","lemma":"நய","gloss":"desire/love"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"ந்","gloss":"glide/past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"pronominal suffix"}],"gloss":"those who loved"},{"surface":"புன்கண்","parts":[{"text":"புன்கண்","lemma":"புன்கண்","gloss":"distress/sorrow"}],"gloss":"distress/sorrow","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தீர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தீர்","lemma":"தீர்","gloss":"resolve/cure"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"increment"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"which cures"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பயந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"பயம்","lemma":"பயம்","gloss":"benefit/fruit"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"place/state"}],"gloss":"yielding benefit"},{"surface":"படாஅ","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"occur/happen"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"negative marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"measure-stretching"}],"gloss":"not obtaining/not yielding"},{"surface":"பண்பினை","parts":[{"text":"பண்பு","lemma":"பண்பு","gloss":"character/quality"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"inflectional increment"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"second person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"you of the character"},{"surface":"எனினே","parts":[{"text":"எனின்","lemma":"எனின்","gloss":"if so"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"if indeed"}]}],"literal":"A male monkey's hand touched, fragrant-pulped big fruit, / guarding forgotten forest-man nearby, / in every guarded tree, catching-nets fastens, / O lord of the hill country! Is it fit? Fresh pool's / water lily's cool leaf-garment, she here to suffer, / of those who loved, the distress curing, / if you are of a character that does not yield benefit.","translation":"O lord of the hills! The hunter, forgetting to guard, now fastens catching-nets on every guarded tree nearby to catch the male monkey that touched the fragrant-pulped big jackfruit. Is it fit for you to have a character that yields no benefit to cure the distress of those who love you, while she suffers here, wearing a cool garment of water-lily leaves from the fresh pool?","modern":"ஆண் குரங்கின் கை தொட்ட, மணம் வீசும் சுளைகளைக் கொண்ட பெரிய பலாப்பழத்தைக் காவல் காக்க மறந்த கானவன், அதன் அருகில் உள்ள காவல் உடைய மரங்கள் தோறும் வலைகளை வீசி மாட்டுகிறான். குன்றுகளின் நாடனே! உன்னை விரும்பியவர்களின் துன்பத்தைத் தீர்க்கும் பயன் தராத பண்பினை உடையவன் நீ என்றால், புதிய சுனையில் மலர்ந்த குவளை மலர்களின் குளிர்ந்த தழையாடையை உடுத்திய இவள் இங்கே வருந்துவது தகுமோ?","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine's friend to the hero, urging him to marry the heroine quickly. She uses an implied metaphor (ullurai) from the mountain landscape. The hunter forgot to guard the sweet jackfruit, allowing a monkey to touch it; now, realizing his mistake, he sets nets on all the nearby trees to catch the monkey. This represents the heroine's family, who previously left her unguarded, allowing the hero to win her love, but have now placed her under strict confinement (irserippu) at home. The friend asks the hero if it is right for him to remain passive and yield no benefit (marriage) to cure the distress of the heroine who loves him, while she suffers in confinement.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.45],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,4.8],[4.8,5.0],[5.0,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.9],[6.9,7.2],[7.2,7.88],[8.56,9.69],[9.84,10.03],[10.03,10.03],[10.03,10.03],[10.03,10.1],[10.1,10.8],[10.8,10.9],[10.9,11.6],[11.6,12.65],[12.65,12.8],[12.8,13.4],[13.4,13.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.65,4.36],[4.4,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,6.28],[6.28,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,6.8],[6.8,12.1],[12.1,12.2],[12.2,12.9],[12.9,14.18],[14.18,14.4],[14.4,14.9],[14.9,15.2]]}}